sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant GW as api-gateway
  participant WL as workload-service
  participant SCH as scheduler-service
  participant TOPO as topology-service
  participant TEL as telemetry-service
  participant SIM as simulator-service
  Op->>GW: POST /api/workloads with JWT
  GW->>WL: forward with X-User headers
  WL->>WL: save as PENDING
  WL-->>Op: 201 Created
  WL->>SCH: workload.submitted
  SCH->>TOPO: GET /internal/topology cached
  SCH->>TEL: GET /internal/telemetry/racks/latest
  SCH->>SCH: score candidates and save the decision
  SCH->>WL: PUT /internal/workloads/id/assignment
  WL->>SIM: workload.assigned
  SIM->>SIM: add heat source to the rack